=1-\\frac83+2=\\frac13\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac13\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"rep","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":"b"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"c"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_6.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-6-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dada la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&3&k\\\\k&1&3\\\\1&7&k\\end{pmatrix}\\)","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Estudia el rango de \\(A\\) en función de los valores del parámetro \\(k\\).","(1,25 p.) Para \\(k=0\\), halla la matriz inversa de \\(A\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&3&k\\\\k&1&3\\\\1&7&k\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(k+9+7 k^{2}\\bigr)-\\bigl(k+21+3 k^{2}\\bigr)\\]\\[=4k^2-12=4(k^2-3)\\]<p>\\(|A|=0\\iff k=\\pm\\sqrt3\\). Además \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&3\\\\1&7\\end{vmatrix}=4\\neq0\\) (filas 1 y 3, columnas 1 y 2) para todo \\(k\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3\\) si \\(k\\neq\\pm\\sqrt3\\); \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\) si \\(k=\\pm\\sqrt3\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&3&0\\\\0&1&3\\\\1&7&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+9+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+21+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-12\\]<p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}-21 & 3 & -1\\\\0 & 0 & -4\\\\9 & -3 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=-\\frac1{12}\\begin{pmatrix}-21 & 0 & 9\\\\3 & 0 & -3\\\\-1 & -4 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{7}{4} & 0 & - \\frac{3}{4}\\\\- \\frac{1}{4} & 0 & \\frac{1}{4}\\\\\\frac{1}{12} & \\frac{1}{3} & - \\frac{1}{12}\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(A^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{7}{4} & 0 & - \\frac{3}{4}\\\\- \\frac{1}{4} & 0 & \\frac{1}{4}\\\\\\frac{1}{12} & \\frac{1}{3} & - \\frac{1}{12}\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"rango","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_6.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-6-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera los puntos \\(A(2,0,1)\\), \\(B(-1,1,2)\\), \\(C(2,2,1)\\) y \\(D(3,1,0)\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Calcula la ecuación del plano \\(\\pi\\) que contiene a los puntos \\(B\\), \\(C\\) y \\(D\\).","(1,5 p.) Halla el punto simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto del plano \\(\\pi\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\overrightarrow{BC}=(3,1,-1)\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{BD}=(4,0,-2)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{BC}\\times\\overrightarrow{BD}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\3&1&-1\\\\4&0&-2\\end{vmatrix}=(-2,\\,2,\\,-4)\\parallel(1,-1,2)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(x-y+2z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(B(-1,1,2)\\): \\(-1-1+4+D=0\\iff D=-2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\pi\\equiv x-y+2z-2=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(C\\): \\(2-2+2-2=0\\) ✓; \\(D\\): \\(3-1+0-2=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Paso 1. Recta perpendicular al plano por el punto.</b> Como la recta \\(s\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) son perpendiculares, el vector normal del plano es paralelo al vector director de la recta<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si la recta es perpendicular al plano, su dirección es la del vector normal del plano: por eso sirve \\(\\vec n\\) como vector director.</i>: \\(\\vec d=\\vec n=(1,\\ -1,\\ 2)\\). Pasa por \\(A(2,\\ 0,\\ 1)\\):</p>\\[s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=2+t\\\\y=-t\\\\z=1+2t\\end{cases}\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(s\\) en \\(\\pi\\equiv x-y+2z-2=0\\):</p>\\[(2+t)-(-t)+2(1+2t)-2=0\\iff 6t+2=0\\iff t=-\\frac{1}{3}\\]\\[M\\left(\\frac{5}{3},\\ \\frac{1}{3},\\ \\frac{1}{3}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(A\\) y su simétrico \\(A'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{2+a}2=\\frac{5}{3},\\qquad\\frac{b}2=\\frac{1}{3},\\qquad\\frac{1+c}2=\\frac{1}{3}\\]\\[a=\\frac{4}{3},\\qquad b=\\frac{2}{3},\\qquad c=-\\frac{1}{3}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":32,\"el\":24,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1.77,1.361,0.795],[0.639,0.23,0.795],[1.563,-0.694,-0.129],[2.694,0.437,-0.129]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.563,-0.694,-0.129],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[1.217,0.783,-0.567],[2.117,-0.117,1.233],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.117,-0.117,1.233],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[2.1,-0.1,1.2],[2.333,-0.333,1.667],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[1.242,-0.091,0.333],[1.476,-0.324,0.8],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"line\",[1.756,0.244,0.513],[1.601,0.088,0.513],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.601,0.088,0.513],[1.511,0.178,0.333],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[2.0,0.0,1.0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.667,0.333,0.333],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[1.333,0.667,-0.333],\"A′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m08r6b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m08r6b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m08r6b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m08r6b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='a